ee-hall","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Genesee Hall","title":"Genesee Hall","subtitle":"First-Year Hill shared-use building","notes":"For an organized study group or workshop, identify an available meeting room through campus processes; residential lounges remain for residents’ use.","short_summary":"A first-year residence building with meeting rooms for study groups and workshops plus student-life and athletics spaces.","evidence_claim":"University Event and Classroom Management says Genesee Hall includes meeting rooms for study groups and workshops, alongside residential and athletics facilities.","source_url":"https://www.rochester.edu/college/ecm/ems-support/genesee.html","source_title":"Genesee Hall | Event and Classroom Management","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The building includes residential floors; access to residential lounges and other rooms may be limited to residents or scheduled users.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
